{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29175","headline":"经李给事旧居 · 许浑","name":"经李给事旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归作儒翁出致君，故山谁复有遗文。\n汉庭使气摧张禹，楚国怀忧送范云。\n枫叶暗时迷旧宅，芳花落处认荒坟。\n朱弦一奏沈湘怨，风起寒波日欲曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}